758
01:00:38.968 --> 01:00:39.969
Apa?

759
01:00:40.845 --> 01:00:41.679
Tentu saja, ini aku.

760
01:00:46.976 --> 01:00:47.977
-Aku sangat baik.
-Tapi sayang,

761
01:00:48.603 --> 01:00:50.855
